  <h1>Les Quatre À La Barre</h1>
  <p>A family, a sailboat, a world tour to fight liver cancer.</p>

  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>We sail around the world to raise awareness about liver cancer and fund our participation in the Golden Globe Race 2030.</p>

  <h2>Why We Sail</h2>
  <p>We sail in memory of my partner, who passed away from an aggressive hepatocellular carcinoma. This project is both a tribute and a commitment to support research.</p>

  <h2>Next Crossing</h2>
  <p>Brixham → Brest — around November 15.</p>

